```

Every ambient fibre of `x:A2->A1` remains a reduced irreducible affine line.
Thus (3.4)--(3.7) add collision incidence, not a second bad ruling fibre.

### 3.3 The full `C_0`-pullback Euler ledger

The exact `2/1/0` census also controls the Euler characteristic of

